,\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... weeks short of her 90th birthday.- Actor\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Director\\n\\nMickey Rooney was born Joe Yule Jr. on September 23, 1920 in Brooklyn, New York. He first took the stage as a toddler in his parents vaudeville act at 17 months old. He made his first film appearance in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d76\"},\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was 79 years old.- Actor\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Director\\n\\nMickey Rooney was born Joe Yule Jr. on September 23, 1920 in Brooklyn, New York. He first took the stage as a toddler in his parents vaudeville act at 17 months old. He made his first film appearance in 1926 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1920\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Married to and divorced from actor John Merivale in the 1940s, Jan later married gruff film star Paul Douglas in 1950. The couple moved away from the Hollywood scene in Burlington, Vermont. The couple appeared together professionally on occasional TV shows and Douglas revived his \\\"Born Yesterday\\\" Harry ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2004\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... Jayanth Jambulingam Chandrasekhar\\n\\nJayanth Jambulingam Chandrasekhar, popularly known as Jay Chandrasekhar, is an American actor, director, screenwriter, and comedian. He was born in Chicago to immigrant parents of Indian origin. He has an extensive portfolio as an actor, appearing in several Hollywood films