and lived with them in Bandra, Mumbai, until her ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aishwarya_Rai_Bachchan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Encyclopedia of Indian Cinema. London: British Film Institute; New Delhi: Oxford University Press. .\\n* \\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* \\n\\nCategory:Indian Hindus\\nCategory:Punjabi Hindus\\nCategory:Arya Samajis\\nCategory:1924 births\\nCategory:1988 deaths\\nCategory:Indian male film actors\\nCategory:Hindi-language film directors\\nCategory:Dadasaheb Phalke Award recipients\\nCategory:Male actors ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raj_Kapoor\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d64\"},\"ref\":\"d64\",\"snippet\":\" ... Priestley denounced the play and Leigh's performance; and the critic Kenneth Tynan, who was to make a habit of dismissing her stage performances, commented that Leigh was badly miscast because British actors were \\\"too well-bred to emote effectively on stage\\\". Olivier and Leigh were chagrined that ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivien_Leigh\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"20cd4c51850ab384ba15d1bb9fa43f3896f6785fc40fdd55c99f15d33f21d9ff\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"5ece3c50909cae5ce0b4d4511dfae05c9f16c769fba90009c057fc7b98426a66\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor described themselves perfectly formed British Indian\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_a6ae7c6b22984096b6c0fc96"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\"